<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia steady at 1.8490 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia steady at 1.8490 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.8490 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>					  May 19	     May 17</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8490	     1.8490</p>
<p> Volume traded			$6.61 mln	  $14.67 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
